## 3. Method (this report)

1. Europe PMC harvest, confirming all the paper's headline numbers are present in the open-access abstract (87 genomes, 123,302 OG clusters, 16–84 SMBGCs, three clades).
2. BV-BRC corpus probe — total *Streptomyces* count and marine-source examples.
3. Genome-size sanity check vs the BGC density implied by the paper.
4. Tool-stack inventory (antiSMASH + OrthoMCL/GET_HOMOLOGUES + phylogenomics).

